  "title": "Shorecook’s Potato Salad with Mayonnaise Dressing",
  "description": "The fantastic flavor of this creamy Yukon Gold potato salad is created by peeling the potatoes and mixing in the rest of the ingredients while the potatoes are still warm.",
  "authors": [
    "SHORECOOK"
